@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts for Anomalous Transactions" as CFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions Based on Historical Data and Market Trends" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Personalized Recommendations Aligned with Financial Profile" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Preferences for Personalized Recommendations" as CFR005
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts When Exceeding Thresholds" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profile" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Access News Related to Investment Portfolio" as CFR008
  usecase "CFR009: Manage Relationship with Financial Advisors, Including Data Sharing Permissions" as CFR009

  usecase "FAFR001: Manage Client Mentoring Sessions Based on System-Generated Insights" as FAFR001
  usecase "FAFR002: View Intervention Alerts for Proactive Assistance to Clients" as FAFR002
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics About Financial Situations During Consultations" as FAFR003
  usecase "FAFR004: Configure Analysis Parameters by Client Segment" as FAFR004

  usecase "SFR012: Generate Client Dashboards for Intuitive and Actionable Views of Finances" as SFR012
  usecase "SFR013: Deliver Contextualized News Based on Financial Portfolios" as SFR013
  usecase "AIFR009: Generate Anomaly Transaction Alerts Using Pattern Recognition for Compliance" as AIFR009

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial insights dashboard.
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters in the system.

  Client --> CFR002 : Receive alerts about anomalous transactions.
  Client --> CFR003 : View financial predictions based on data and trends.
  Client --> CFR004 : Get personalized recommendations aligned with profile.
  Client --> CFR005 : Adjust preferences for recommendations.
  Client --> CFR006 : Monitor spending limits via alerts.
  Client --> CFR007 : Explore investment opportunities matching risk profile.
  Client --> CFR008 : Access portfolio-related news.
  Client --> CFR009 : Manage interactions with advisors, including data sharing.

  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR001 : Schedule mentoring sessions using system insights.
  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR002 : Review intervention alerts for proactive client support.
  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR003 : Use predictive analytics during consultations.
  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR004 : Customize analysis parameters by segment.

  System --> SFR012 : Generate dashboards for clients.
  System --> SFR013 : Provide contextualized news to clients.
  
  AI --> AIFR009 : Detect and report anomaly transactions based on patterns recognized in financial data.

}

@enduml